: -97pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">교육대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">의료기기 산업 분야에 취업을 희망하는 졸업자 및 졸업예정자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">미취업자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 94.5pt; margin-right: 5pt; text-indent: -94.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">                 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">졸업예정자의 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">마지막 학기에 재학중으로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">개월 이내 취업이 가능한 자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">특수대학원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">취업 및 대학원 진학 병행이 가능하며 수업이 야간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">주말</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">계절제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">방학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">), </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">사이버 등으로 운영</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">에 재학 중으로 취업 및 교육 수강이 가능한 자는 예외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 94.5pt; margin-right: 5pt; text-indent: -94.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">교육방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">온라인 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">비대면</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">지원내용</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">1) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">의료기기 전</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">全</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">주기 분야 교육</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">(24</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">(168h))</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">2) (</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">수료</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">참여수당</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">(21</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">만원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">지급</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">국가공인 의료기기 규제과학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">(RA)</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">전문가 자격시험 응시자격 부여</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">3) (</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">우수학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">실무능력 향상을 위한 </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">현장실습 및 기업 재직자의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">1:1 </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">멘토링제 </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">운영</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">* </span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;\">자세한 교육일정 및 교육내용은 붙임파일 확인</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">바</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">교육문의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">인재교육본부 교육기획팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(02-860-4352, 4357)</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"15225\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 0,\n\"dv\": 5,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.0\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"9, 1, 1, 5656\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_Unknown_Version\"\n},\n\"dis\": false,\n\"ds\": {\n\"ti\": \"\",\n\"la\": \"ko\",\n\"cr\": \"\",\n\"su\": \"\",\n\"de\": \"\",\n\"cd\": \"2022-04-04T13:12:06.881Z\",\n\"md\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\",\n\"pd\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\",\n\"ke\": \"\"\n}\n},\n\"dh\": {\n\"do\": {\n\"pa\": 1,\n\"fo\": 1,\n\"en\": 1,\n\"pi\": 1,\n\"tb\": 1,\n\"eq\": 1\n},\n\"fo\": [ ],\n\"cd\": {\n\"tp\": 0,\n\"lc\": {\n\"af\": false,\n\"ui\": false,\n\"fu\": false,\n\"dn\": false,\n\"ul\": false,\n\"el\": false,\n\"at\": false,\n\"tq\": false,\n\"da\": false,\n\"dw\": false,\n\"dj\": false,\n\"bc\": false,\n\"bu\": false,\n\"al\": false,\n\"ab\": false,\n\"ap\": false,\n\"an\": false,\n\"aa\": false,\n\"ds\": false,\n\"de\": false,\n\"as\": false,\n\"cp\": false,\n\"ao\": false,\n\"et\": false,\n\"ay\": false,\n\"am\": false,\n\"a1\": false,\n\"bt\": false,\n\"av\": false,\n\"dh\": false,\n\"dp\": false,\n\"d1\": false,\n\"mf\": false,\n\"bl\": false,\n\"ag\": false,\n\"dg\": false,\n\"ae\": false,\n\"df\": false,\n\"do\": false,\n\"dl\": false,\n\"di\": false,\n\"d2\": fals